         "html": "<p><strong>Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary</strong>, <a href=\"/directions/\">located in the Rt. 6 shopping plaza in South Wellfleet</a>, offers the largest selection of quality products at the best prices and proudly serves Cape Cod community residents and visitors alike, handling all your cannabis needs. We have 900+ <img src=\"assets/source/b037f031-5-stars_200-1.png\" alt=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/5-stars_200-1.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\"> reviews with a 4.9 / 5.0 star rating…see what your neighbors are <a href=\"/customer-reviews/\">saying about their experience</a>.<br><br></p>"
        },
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": 5,
         "text": "Trusted by Cape Cod residents and visitors since 2021."
