       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": 2,
         "text": "🅿️ Easy Parking"
        },
        {
         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p>For your convenience, we have 26 dedicated parking spaces. Several municipal parking spaces are located in the shopping plaza at no charge as well. <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Cape+Cod+Cannabis+Dispensary+Wellfleet+1446+State+Hwy+Wellfleet,+MA+02667/@41.916266,-69.988363,11z/data=!4m8!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x89fb67b4dd623abb:0xe9a627c2ee8ebdce!2m2!1d-69.988363!2d41.916266?entry=ttu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click here for directions</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": 2,
         "text": "💵 Debit & Cash Accepted"
        },
        {
         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p>We accept cash, debit cards, and <a href=\"https://www.canpaydebit.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CanPay</a>. ATM is available on site. ATM and Debit transactions will incur a small merchant fee.</p>"
        },
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": 2,
         "text": "🛒 Order Online & Pickup"
        },
        {
         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p>You can <a href=\"/menu/\">place an order online</a>, set the time of pick-up, and quickly pick up your order. </p>"
        },
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": 2,
         "text": "ℹ️ Expert Cannabis Guidance"
        },
        {
         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p>To guide you through the process and consult you on your cannabis needs.<em> No hassle and at your own pace.</em></p>"
        }
       ]
